{"g":"2026-09-07T04:45:00+08:00","s":[16,9,7,3.79],"a":[["AWD-0001","Bagas Jaya Andika","Universitas Tadulako","Teknik Mesin","2021","Lulus","","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eKiE0fwa1oxRxNpGEfn57H3AAfQYwn5B/view?usp=sharing"],["AWD-0002","Siti Anita","Universitas Tadulako","Teknik Lingkungan","2021","Lulus","","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-uIJizJgVFd_Oy535syz1-y-6n63Tjm6/view?usp=drive_link"],["AWD-0003","Maulidiya Safina","Universitas Tadulako","","2021","Lulus","","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zPF76U1OVhprMTq2_facC8qUpAWvsBnu/view?usp=drive_link"],["AWD-0004","Riskawati","Universitas Tadulako","Pendidikan Bahasa Indonesia","2021","Lulus","","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1svCFI0Dk0I12mJXZfeYNL7KtQ3d2QBf1/view?usp=drive_link"],["AWD-0005","Karmila","Universitas Tadulako","Pendidikan Matematika","2022","Lulus","","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1J4wmNCHEDZVyW9QhnMyMqYa8HE6nUUV1/view?usp=drive_link"],["AWD-0006","Wahyu Hidayat","Universitas Tadulako","Kimia","2022","Lulus","","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zm736nNMd7Nb4Fz412vAi9NbwVqQdy_G/view?usp=sharing"],["AWD-0007","Nurul Hafizatul Isnaini","Universitas Tadulako","Pendidikan Bahasa Inggris","2022","Lulus","","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sW6m7OmyRXCcCQbGeVZ7mMLneNeW8WPI/view?usp=sharing"],["AWD-0008","Nabila Fauziyah","Universitas Tadulako","Teknik Lingkungan","2023","Aktif","\"Menjadi manusia yang terus belajar dan tumbuh, menghidupkan potensi diri untuk memberi makna, memberdayakan sesama, dan menciptakan peradaban yang berakar pada ilmu, nilai, dan keimanan.\"","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CuFAP8c6OXYbc_U9J7nwAXyhPzo1NSmM/view?usp=drivesdk"],["AWD-0009","Samsudaris","Universitas Tadulako","Hukum","2023","Aktif","Menjadi insan hukum yang berintegritas, cakap dan berdampak, yang tidak hanya memahami hukum secara teori, tetapi mampu menerapkannya untuk menegakkan keadilan, mengedukasi masyarakat, dan membawa perubahan positif di berbagai lini kehidupan.","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1W6Ck7Z9BZl-WvhyoBpNDa69pifAXyIYE/view?usp=drivesdk"],["AWD-0010","Muh. Ridho Pangestu","Universitas Tadulako","Pendidikan Bahasa Inggris","2023","Aktif","Menjadi pribadi yang bisa bermanfaat dan mampu menyebarluaskan ilmu yang dimiliki kepada banyak orang.","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1GxkIMIHyq7iuc8K23s1cTRVIYaCthaxS/view?usp=drivesdk"],["AWD-0011","Freti Putri Ananta","Universitas Tadulako","Fisika Murni","2023","Aktif","Menjadi pribadi yang unggul, berintegritas, dan bermanfaat bagi masyarakat dengan terus mengembangkan potensi diri, memperluas wawasan, serta memberikan kontribusi nyata melalui ilmu pengetahuan, kepemimpinan,dan pengabdian.","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1c-fybQvf4MFsx9nzBHNUn93SPMLFtyxz/view?usp=drivesdk"],["AWD-0012","Julita Amanda","Universitas Tadulako","Manajemen","2023","Aktif"," Menjadi CEO perempuan tangguh, berani, jujur dan percaya diri di bidang pemasaran dan komunikasi digital yang menginspirasi dunia, membawa budaya Islam ke panggung global, dan memperjuangkan kesetaraan serta nilai kemanusiaan melalui bisnis global.","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1B4WN_hOZpa2znBWFBwXkVpHKz5FtOZwj/view?usp=drivesdk"],["AWD-0013","Suci Rahmadani","Universitas Tadulako","Pendidikan Biologi","2023","Aktif","Menjadi pribadi  yang dapat menebar kebermanfaatan kepada orang banyak, mampu memberikan  dampak positif bagi sesama, menjalani hidup dengan penuh makna dan rasa syukur, serta menjadi seorang pendidik yang berprofesional dan mampu menerapkan nilai-nilai  integritas di kehidupan sehari hari.","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cVaQfE3Y-uh_h_mYZH99c3GxdGU2dI5R/view?usp=drivesdk"],["AWD-0014","Ahmad Irwan Affandi","Universitas Tadulako","Akuntansi","2023","Aktif","Menjadi pribadi yang berintegritas dan profesional, yang terus belajar dan berkembang, serta memberi manfaat, inspirasi, dan kontribusi positif bagi masyarakat.","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SEC_GRNVVvDIRlbrCFSMFiQ8ZE5RzaLD/view?usp=drivesdk"],["AWD-0015","Afifah Khairunnisa","Universitas Tadulako","Pendidikan Bahasa & Sastra","2023","Aktif","Untuk kedepannya, aku berharap dengan segala kemampuan yang ada, dari menulis, berkomunikasi, dan membangun hubungan, aku berharap mampu menciptakan ruang aman untuk orang lain, bermanfaat untuk orang lain, khususnya untuk mereka yang selalu ada untuk saya, dan untuk mereka yang tidak pernah merasa punya ruang untuk dihargai . Mewujudkan impian membuat perpustakaan pribadi di daerah sendiri, menjadi penulis best seller se Internasional.","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1igJF4AosnMzK3ymcarttdeYAzjreqvwn/view?usp=drivesdk"],["AWD-0016","Moh. Royhan Lakoro","Universitas Tadulako","Teknik Sipil","2023","Aktif","Menjadi insan hukum yang berintegritas, cakap dan berdampak, yang tidak hanya memahami hukum secara teori, tetapi mampu menerapkannya untuk menegakkan keadilan, mengedukasi masyarakat, dan membawa perubahan positif di berbagai lini kehidupan.","https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yt3q8qBAHjdA1tL5xX46uLqgU4V2lWEY/view?usp=drivesdk"]],"k":[["AKD-001","AWD-0001","1-8",3.64],["AKD-002","AWD-0002","1-8",null],["AKD-003","AWD-0003","1-8",null],["AKD-004","AWD-0004","1-8",null],["AKD-005","AWD-0005","1-8",null],["AKD-006","AWD-0006","1-8",3.77],["AKD-007","AWD-0007","1-8",null],["AKD-008","AWD-0008","1",3.93],["AKD-009","AWD-0008","2",3.76],["AKD-010","AWD-0008","3",3.76],["AKD-011","AWD-0008","4",3.76],["AKD-012","AWD-0008","5",3.77],["AKD-013","AWD-0009","1",4.0],["AKD-014","AWD-0009","2",3.95],["AKD-015","AWD-0009","3",4.0],["AKD-016","AWD-0009","4",3.87],["AKD-017","AWD-0009","5",3.98],["AKD-018","AWD-0010","1",3.55],["AKD-019","AWD-0010","2",3.73],["AKD-020","AWD-0010","3",3.75],["AKD-021","AWD-0010","4",3.96],["AKD-022","AWD-0010","5",3.94],["AKD-023","AWD-0011","1",3.71],["AKD-024","AWD-0011","2",3.89],["AKD-025","AWD-0011","3",3.82],["AKD-026","AWD-0011","4",3.88],["AKD-027","AWD-0011","5",3.95],["AKD-028","AWD-0012","1",3.7],["AKD-029","AWD-0012","2",3.73],["AKD-030","AWD-0012","3",3.76],["AKD-0